    "description": "<p><strong>Engram</strong></p><p><strong>Impulse Leap: Spend a Hope</strong> to jump anywhere within Close range.</p><p><strong>Kinetic Push:</strong> Make a <strong>Power Roll</strong> against a target within Very Close range. On a success, <strong>spend a Hope</strong> to deal <strong>d8 + your Power Trait</strong> kinetic damage using your Proficiency and push them back to Close range.</p><p><strong>Psionic Burst: Mark a Stress</strong> to make a <strong>Power Roll</strong> against all adversaries within Melee range. Targets you succeed against take <strong>d8 + your Power Trait</strong> energy damage using your Proficiency.</p>",
